@title PLC card dialog and overview: a bad layout is a triangle row with its reason in a popup
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# T8: Draw > PLC > Add PLC card. A layout that does not parse is a triangle row in the dialog (click it for the reason); the popup holds the reason.
key ctrl+n
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text add plc card
wait 6
key Enter
wait 15
click 1770 334
wait 3
key ctrl+a
wait 2
text abc
wait 3
click_text "Add card"
wait 10
shot bad-layout-row
check_layout
# The popup names the reason and offers Copy.
click 1616 486
wait 6
expect "the slot must be a number"
expect "Copy"
shot bad-layout-popup
